Package: wgw
Title: Interactive 3D Figures of Arrays and wgw Widgets
Version: 0.1.0
Description: wgw for R: meshes, points, curves and vector fields in a window, drawn by wgw's WebAssembly core
    through wgw-window, with sliders and picks that call R functions. Needs wgw-window from wgw's repository.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
